<%- include('partials/header') %>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h1>About StudyFlow</h1>

      <div class="about-content">
        <div class="about-card">
          <h2>What is StudyFlow?</h2>
          <p>StudyFlow is a student task management application designed to help students organize their academic workload. It allows you to add study tasks, set deadlines, assign priorities, and keep track of everything you need to get done — all from a simple, easy-to-use interface.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card">
          <h2>Why Use StudyFlow?</h2>
          <p>As a student, juggling multiple subjects, assignments, and deadlines can be overwhelming. StudyFlow gives you a central place to plan your study schedule, so you can focus on what matters most — learning. Whether you have one assignment or twenty, StudyFlow keeps you organized.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card">
          <h2>About This Project</h2>
          <p>StudyFlow is being developed as part of a <strong>Full Stack Development Internship</strong>. The project is built progressively across multiple tasks, starting from basic HTML structure and server-side rendering, and eventually growing into a full-featured web application with user authentication, database storage, and a modern frontend.</p>
          <p>This is <strong>Task 1</strong>, which focuses on setting up the project structure, creating EJS templates, and handling basic form submission with Express.js.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

